    \"m_Content\": \"The difference between the ZDepth Buffer and Object Position
    should give you a thin \\\"interface\\\" where other geometry touches the forcefield
    mesh. \\n\\nUse OneMinus to switch from black to white.\\n\\nThen use Smoothstep
    to interpolate and Multiply to increase/decrease the intensity.\",\n    \"m_TextSize\":
    0,\n    \"m_Theme\": 0,\n    \"m_Position\": {\n        \"serializedVersion\":
